ort flags, failure classes, resume and log shape, and what single executor contract would remove the differences?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"cross cli parity where do cli claude code cli opencode cli codex cli pi cli devin cli cursor cli deepseek harness and cli mistral vibe lineages still differ in permissions effort flags failure classes resume and log shape and what single executor contract would remove the differences\"}\n3: {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-006\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review, specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review-archive\",\"question\":\"Cost and latency: what do the 8-11 minute setup, the cost per iteration, the 24-iteration ceiling and the 50/35/15 depth-band split cost in the measured runs under the spec folder's review/ and review-archive/ and the live playbook logs, and which change cuts the most time or money?\",\"status\":\"open\",\"reason\":null,\"iteration\":0,\"dedupeKey\":\"cost and latency what do the 8 11 minute setup the cost per iteration the 24 iteration ceiling and the 50 35 15 depth band split cost in the measured runs under the spec folder s review and review archive and the live playbook logs and which change cuts the most time or money\"}","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/frontier-nodes.jsonl, lines 1-3\n1: {\"nodeId\":\"F-1-002\",\"parentId\":\"root\",\"depth\":1,\"scope\":\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt\",\"question\":\"Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults