ystem-deep-loop): accept only a positive whole proposal budget\ncf9e2aa7618 fix(system-deep-loop): key frontier dedupe on letters and digits of every script\n2c661d3db70 fix(system-deep-loop): redact every prompt argument in the lineage preview\ndf01a230055 fix(system-deep-loop): name the command that prints a lineage FRONTIER block\na42efa78fef fix(system-deep-loop): deal frontier nodes in code-unit order like the merge\n4c6a3a41f03 fix(system-deep-loop): keep a fan-out review from rewriting packet metadata\n30c88ac2e2a feat(system-deep-loop): preview fan-out lineage commands without writing\nf2de4f588c5 fix(system-deep-loop): announce a dead lineage and redact provider ids\na6c1332a331 fix(system-deep-loop): fulfil a fan-out lineage only on a terminal stop row\n00aa041712b fix(system-deep-loop): read a findingsNew list as new findings in node stuck\na185d5cc95b test(system-deep-loop): pin the stop decision's read of the node store\n5e0415e6cf5 fix(system-deep-loop): read fallback ledger evidence from search actions\n1a324922706 docs(system-deep-loop): say what the traceability test shares with nodes\nb13df59792a fix(system-deep-loop): count stuck passes per node under expansive depth\nbcf3e2f05d4 fix(system-deep-loop): count only evidence-bearing iterations as frontier visits\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"d4420e9510d docs(system-deep-loop): state the narrowed node universe in two comments\n67662c5065e test(system-deep-loop): assert the zone switch in the zone-less stamp test\ne18bbc6e30c docs(system-deep-loop): state the lineage completion order rule\n1ea09919553 fix(system-deep-loop): judge lineage completion order by file position\n99f288e20b1 docs(system-deep-loop): align docs with the frontier and fan-out runner fixes\nb4e482bcb91 docs(specs): amend the review pivot requirement to match the workflow\n377055592a5 feat(deep): show the Claude config dir in the fan-out preview\n99a12d54838 feat(deep): preview fan-out lineage commands on a dry run\n481695a051f test(system-deep-loop): fail a lineage that iterates after its terminal stop row\n600d84b1677 fix(system-deep-loop): mask provider ids in kept and failed lineage logs\nadd05aaf624 fix(system-deep-loop): order frontier nodes by code unit in both reducers\n2dfae3ec532 fix(system-deep-loop): classify Windows-separated source paths like POSIX ones\ne5ae5ee053f refactor(system-deep-loop): summarize merged traceability with the reducer\nae10e9343e5 fix(system-deep-loop): keep the agreed graph coverage mode a lineage omits\n2f6effb5bb9 fix(system-deep-loop): split a commit-range target on commas for git\n691bb7bc61c fix(system-deep-loop): keep combining marks in the frontier dedupe key\na4ca1b2dfe6 test(system-deep-loop): pin the guard on the pivot attempt-2 config rewrite\na65c81b19b3 docs(deep-review): say the review stuck count is per frontier node\n===\nd4420e9510d docs(system-deep-loop): state the narrowed node universe in two comments\n67662c5065e test(system-deep-loop): assert the zone switch in the zone-less stamp test\ne18bbc6e30c docs(system-deep-loop): state the lineage completion order rule\n1ea09919553 fix(system-deep-loop): judge lineage completion order by file position\n99f288e20b1 docs(system-deep-loop): align docs with the frontier and fan-out runner fixes\nb4e482bcb91 docs(specs): amend the review pivot requirement to match the workflow\n377055592a5 feat(deep): show the Claude config dir in the fan-out preview\n99a12d54838 feat(deep): preview fan-out lineage commands on a dry run\n481695a051f test(system-deep-loop): fail a lineage that iterates after its terminal stop row\n600d84b1677 fix(system-deep-loop): mask provider ids in kept and failed lineage logs\nadd05aaf624 fix(system-deep-loop): order frontier nodes by code unit in both reducers\n2dfae3ec532 fix(system-deep-loop): classify Windows-separated source paths like POSIX ones\ne5ae5ee053f refactor(system-deep-loop): summarize merged traceability with the reducer\nae10e9343e5 fix(system-deep-loop): keep the agreed graph coverage mode a lineage omits\n2f6effb5bb9 fix(system-deep-loop): split a commit-range target on commas for git\n691bb7bc61c fix(system-deep-loop): keep combining marks in the frontier dedupe key\na4ca1b2dfe6 test(system-deep-loop): pin the guard on the pivot attempt-2 config rewrite\na65c81b19b3 docs(deep-review): say the review stuck count is per frontier node\n4519f1eccfd refactor(deep-review): define the frontier seed decomposition once\n504a91778f9 fix(deep-review): name frontier_drained in the --extend re-stop warning\n260f50e9916 fix(system-deep-loop): record a commit range's touched files from git\n43de87a94cb fix(system-deep-loop): test every word of a review proposal scope\ndfbf0f0745f fix(system-deep-loop): read an open-ended git range as a range\n3e81a73f2e7 fix(system-deep-loop): accept only a positive whole proposal budget\ncf9e2aa7618 fix(system-deep-loop): key frontier dedupe on letters and digits of every script\n2c661d3db70 fix(system-deep-loop): redact every prompt argument in the lineage preview\ndf01a230055 fix(system-deep-loop): name the command that prints a lineage FRONTIER block\na42efa78fef fix(system-deep-loop): deal frontier nodes in code-unit order like the merge\n4c6a3a41f03 fix(system-deep-loop): keep a fan-out review from rewriting packet metadata\n30c88ac2e2a feat(system-deep-loop): preview fan-out lineage commands without writing\nf2de4f588c5 fix(system-deep-loop): announce a dead lineage and redact provider ids\na6c1332a331 fix(system-deep-loop): fulfil a fan-out lineage only on a terminal stop row\n00aa041712b fix(system-deep-loop): read a findingsNew list as new findings in node stuck\na185d5cc95b test(system-deep-loop): pin the stop decision's read of the node store\n5e0415e6cf5 fix(system-deep-loop): read fallback ledger evidence from search actions\n1a324922706 docs(system-deep-loop): say what the traceability test