{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795137717121,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f68bc2480016hRljUx4QrSoUX","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f68bbccf001ppgNiUWb5u4VJ7","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9aadb4ad40eddd5","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs block --artifact-dir specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek --focus-file specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/frontier-focus.txt; echo \"EXIT=$?\""},"output":"\n\nFRONTIER (expansive depth)\nCurrent node: F-1-002 at depth 1 of 3, scope .skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt.\nCopy the Focus Area line exactly into this iteration record's \"focus\", so the run can tell which node this iteration worked.\nYou may append up to 2 `frontier_proposal` rows to this iteration's delta with \"parentId\":\"F-1-002\", one per follow-up question your evidence opened inside this node. Each row needs \"question\", \"scope\" and \"evidence\". The admission step prunes duplicates, anything past the depth or fan-out caps, and any budget above one the parent recorded.EXIT=0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nFRONTIER (expansive depth)\nCurrent node: F-1-002 at depth 1 of 3, scope .skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt.\nCopy the Focus Area line exactly into this iteration record's \"focus\", so the run can tell which node this iteration worked.\nYou may append up to 2 `frontier_proposal` rows to this iteration's delta with \"parentId\":\"F-1-002\", one per follow-up question your evidence opened inside this node. Each row needs \"question\", \"scope\" and \"evidence\". The admission step prunes duplicates, anything past the depth or fan-out caps, and any budget above one the parent recorded.EXIT=0\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs block --artifact-dir specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek --focus-file specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/frontier-focus.txt; echo \\\"EXIT=$?\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1795137716808,"end":1795137717121}}}}
