{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795137777157,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f68ca06d001gso0DgDe8XyaO8","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f68c94f2001glX6QpYPnO6Xcj","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-87fefcc9b02d2eed","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Frontier node F-1-002 (depth 1, scope .skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt): Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All five findings are new to this lineage and each names a concrete change with a file:line anchor.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview, and how does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Presentation assets as an independent intake surface\",\"Frontier-cap refusal as an undocumented trap\"],\"focusTrack\":\"operator-ux\",\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:107\",\".skilled/commands/deep/review.md:100\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:772\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4837\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs:521\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/fanout-config-recovery.json:1\"],\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"research.md:107 still carries the 486-word --depth-mode table cell that review.md:100 already collapsed to a pointer, so the same discoverability defect is fixed on one surface only.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:107\",\".skilled/commands/deep/review.md:100\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt:74\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"No --only-lineage/--retry-failed filter exists in fanout-run.cjs; a rerun re-dispatches every lineage and mints fresh sessions for completed ones, which then fail the completion check, so recovery from a provider quota today requires hand-editing fanout-config.json.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:772\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3935\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4837\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/fanout-config-recovery.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The fan-out dry run prints frontier_scope: [] for an unseeded expansive run, which reads the same as a lineage dealt no nodes; emit null plus a pending-seed status instead.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4007\",\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:145\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Question intake has two live paths (strategy Section 3 legacy-import and inbox.jsonl), and this lineage's dashboard shows the resulting duplicate state: 9 open questions from 6 topics with 3 near-duplicates.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:34\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/deep-research-strategy.md:61\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:928\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The zero-growth-slot budget warning is printed only by frontier-admit budget, which a fan-out lineage skips, so no fan-out operator ever sees a per-lineage budget or growth-slot count.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs:521\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:839\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4007\"]}\n{\"type\":\"frontier_proposal\",\"parentId\":\"F-1-002\",\"question\":\"What does a partially complete fan-out run tell the operator: does the summary name the failed lineage, its failure class and the exact command to rerun just that lineage?\",\"scope\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml\",\"evidence\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\"}\n{\"type\":\"frontier_proposal\",\"parentId\":\"F-1-002\",\"question\":\"Do the research and review dashboards expose per-frontier-node budget spend and visit counts, or only lineage-wide iteration totals?\",\"scope\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs, .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\",\"evidence\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2503\"}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating the presentation assets as an independent question intake surface\",\"reason\":\"Both assets restate the same long-form budget prose as the command docs; collapsing the command row moves the copy rather than adding a surface.\",\"iteration\":1}\n","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Frontier node F-1-002 (depth 1, scope .skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt): Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-r