{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795137893006,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f68e6eb4001t6N2yst2uJrjUA","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f68e668e001K6BDUYUx4HTStG","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a347d29d4e79b87","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && grep -rn \"Observed cost\\|Observed duration\\|tokens\\|minutes\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"cost\\|token\\|minute\" | head -30"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-expansive-research-two-node-frontier.md:34:- Observed cost: about 28 to 29 minutes; 0.69M to 1.03M input, 0.07M to 0.08M output, 0.06M to 0.08M reasoning and 14.4M to 17.1M cache-read tokens over three iterations, across two runs.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-extend-expansive-research-run.md:34:- Observed cost: about 11 minutes; 0.33M input, 0.03M output, 0.03M reasoning and 6.2M cache-read tokens for the one added iteration.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-research-run.md:52:8. `cd .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime && npx vitest run workflow-restart-lifecycle.vitest -t 'extend-minutes'` (the `--extend-minutes=M` cases)\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-research-run.md:56:Command 1 prints the `--extend` binding and the extension step. Command 2 prints the `run_extended` stem and its payload type. Command 3 exits 0 with no failed test. After command 4 finishes, command 5 prints `1`, command 6 shows the original `sessionId`, generation 1, `maxIterations` at the prior count plus 3 and `lineageMode` `completed-continue`, and command 7 lists one snapshot file. The run adds exactly three iteration files. Command 8 exits 0 with 4 tests passed and none failed. They cover the `--extend-minutes` binding in both commands, the refusal of a value that is not a positive integer, and the case where `--extend-minutes` replaces the default added minutes.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-research-run.md:75:- Duration: on a fresh copy of the completed fixture, run command 4 with `--extend=3 --extend-minutes=30`. Then run `jq '{maxDurationMinutes, createdAt}' <completed-fixture-spec-folder>/research/deep-research-config.json`. `maxDurationMinutes` equals the larger of the prior budget and the minutes elapsed since `createdAt`, plus 30. `createdAt` keeps its original value. Without `--extend-minutes`, the added minutes default to the prior budget.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-research-run.md:76:- Refusal: run the command with `--extend-minutes=30` and no `--extend`, and confirm it stops with a usage error that names the flag before any state write.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-research-run.md:96:| `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/unit/workflow-restart-lifecycle.vitest.ts` | Workflow case that keeps the original `sessionId` and generation, plus the `--extend-minutes` binding and duration budget cases |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-custom-dimension-review.md:34:- Observed cost: about 36 minutes; 0.56M input, 0.05M output, 0.09M reasoning and 15.4M cache-read tokens over two iterations.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-expansive-review-two-node-frontier.md:34:- Observed cost: about 24 to 38 minutes; 0.57M to 0.75M input, 0.05M to 0.06M output, 0.09M to 0.10M reasoning and 11.9M to 13.7M cache-read tokens over three iterations, across three runs.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-review-run.md:53:9. `cd .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime && npx vitest run workflow-restart-lifecycle.vitest -t 'extend-minutes'` (the `--extend-minutes=M` cases)\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-review-run.md:59:Command 1 prints the `--extend` binding and the extension step in both files. Command 2 prints the `run_extended` stem and its payload type. Command 3 exits 0 with no failed test. After command 4 finishes, command 5 prints `1`, command 6 shows the original `sessionId`, generation 1, `maxIterations` at the prior count plus 3 and `lineageMode` `completed-continue`, command 7 lists one snapshot file, and command 8 shows three more iteration files than before the run. Command 9 exits 0 with 4 tests passed and none failed. For review, that run checks only the `--extend-minutes` binding in `review.md`, the presentation file and the preflight step. The duration budget cases are research tests, so the live duration check under Optional Supplemental Checks covers the review budget.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/extend-completed-review-run.md:78:- Duration: on a fresh copy of the completed fixture, run command 4 with `--extend=3 --extend-minutes=30`. Then run `jq '{maxDurationMinutes, createdAt}' <artifact_dir>/deep-review-config.json`. `maxDurationMinutes` equals the larger of the prior budget and the minutes elapsed since `createdAt`, plus 30. `createdAt` keeps its original value. Without `--extend-minutes`, the added minutes default to the prior budget.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-test