teration record's \"focus\", so the run can tell which node this iteration worked.\nYou may append up to 2 `frontier_proposal` rows to this iteration's delta with \"parentId\":\"F-1-006\", one per follow-up question your evidence opened inside this node. Each row needs \"question\", \"scope\" and \"evidence\". The admission step prunes duplicates, anything past the depth or fan-out caps, and any budget above one the parent recorded."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs block --artifact-dir specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek --focus-file specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/frontier-focus.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1795137926261,"end":1795137926491}}}}
