{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795137933441,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f68f01360010ZEz4xXWctyy6w","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f68ef8d4001CioLBQjV2VDC1i","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae9c176561c521de","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Frontier node F-1-006 (depth 1, scope specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review, specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review-archive): Cost and latency: what do the 8-11 minute setup, the cost per iteration, the 24-iteration ceiling and the 50/35/15 depth-band split cost in the measured runs under the spec folder's review/ and review-archive/ and the live playbook logs, and which change cuts the most time or money?\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All five findings are new measurements or new arithmetic against the committed runs and playbook logs.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What do the 8-11 minute setup, the cost per iteration, the 24-iteration ceiling and the 50/35/15 depth-band split cost in the measured runs under the spec folder's review/ and review-archive/ and the live playbook logs, and which change cuts the most time or money?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Model price as the main lever\",\"Fan-out concurrency as the cause of the quota failure\"],\"focusTrack\":\"cost\",\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:464\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-extend-expansive-research-run.md:34\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs:360\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review-archive/20261119T153733Z/deep-review-config.json:1\"],\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The 24-iteration ceiling is unreachable at the measured 8-11 minutes per iteration under the default 120-minute duration budget; the duration stop binds near iteration 11-15, and one archive run already raised the budget to 360 minutes for 10 iterations.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:464\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-expansive-research-two-node-frontier.md:34\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review-archive/20261119T153733Z/deep-review-config.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Setup costs 3-10 minutes per lineage before iteration 1 (createdAt to first iteration), and a fan-out pays it per lineage although the root has already resolved the topic and partitioned the frontier.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/opus/deep-review-config.json:1\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review-archive/20261119T153733Z/deep-review-state.jsonl:1\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:117\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"The fixed 50/35/15 split gives a three-node review exactly 12 depth-1 iterations at a 24 cap, which is exactly the 3 nodes x 4 dimensions cost, leaving zero growth; the protocol pushes the doubling arithmetic onto the operator.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs:360\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:464\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Per-iteration cost is dominated by cache re-read of unchanged context (6.2M cache-read vs 0.33M input per iteration), and the prompt pack restates the full topic and state summary every iteration.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-extend-expansive-research-run.md:34\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/manual-testing-playbook/entry-points-and-modes/live-expansive-research-two-node-frontier.md:34\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:12\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"No host-measured durationMs reaches the iteration record, so latency claims rest on model-written timestamps that mix queue, model and idle time even though fanout-run already computes slotDurationMs.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4058\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/prompt-pack-iteration.md.tmpl:67\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review-archive/20261119T183614Z/deep-review-state.jsonl:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"frontier_proposal\",\"parentId\":\"F-1-006\",\"question\":\"Do the dispatch receipts under each lineage carry slotDurationMs, and can that field be joined to the iteration row to separate model time from queue time in the archive runs?\",\"scope\":\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review, .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\"evidence\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4058\"}\n{\"type\":\"frontier_proposal\",\"parentId\":\"F-1-006\",\"question\":\"What is the measured setup time per executor kind, and does skipping the context ladder in a fan-out child actually remove it?\",\"scope\":\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml, review/lineages\",\"evidence\":\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/opus/deep-review-config.json:1\"}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating model price as the main cost lever\",\"reason\":\"The measured cost is dominated by cache-read of unchanged context and by wall-clock latency, so a cheaper model changes the multiplier rather than the shape.\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_