{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795137980805,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f68fbd430016IrAlJ2hiLioop","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f68fafe0001OEpnnOE2beC3z5","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad0ec6448d3aaa5a","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Frontier node F-1-002 (depth 1, scope .skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt): Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All five findings are new: the summary, observability stream, dashboard and this lineage's own band spend each expose a distinct operator gap.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"The dashboard hiding band spend\",\"A new summary file\"],\"focusTrack\":\"operator-ux\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/orchestration-summary.json:1\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/observability-events.jsonl:1\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:108\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\",\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:107\"],\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"orchestration-summary.json reports only aggregate failure classes; it has no per-lineage label/status/reason/rerun_command array, so an operator must open the status log to learn which lineage failed and what to type.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/orchestration-summary.json:1\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/fanout-config-recovery.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The dashboard frontier section shows band spend and a node count but no per-node visits or status, so three single-node passes and three passes on one node look identical even though the registry already holds the visit records.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:108\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2491\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Every observability-events.jsonl row carries subject.run_id null, so the event stream cannot be joined to a run or a lineage without parsing free text.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/observability-events.jsonl:1\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4801\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The quota failure names the cause but not the action; the single-executor workflow already has the actionable line 'Switch executor or wait, then resume this run', and the fan-out path does not carry it or a lineage-specific resume step.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:1898\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"A 3-node CLI lineage gets the flat 10-iteration floor, which funds only 5 depth-1 visits; this lineage's own dashboard shows 3 of 5 spent after three first passes, leaving no room for the verification pass each node needs.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:113\",\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:107\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:844\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Claiming the dashboard hides band spend\",\"reason\":\"The dashboard prints all three band allotments and their spend; the missing dimension is per-node detail.\",\"iteration\":4}\n","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":4,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Frontier node F-1-002 (depth 1, scope .skilled/commands/deep/research.md, .skilled/commands/deep/review.md, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt): Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":5,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All five findings are new: the summary, observability stream, dashboard and this lineage's own band spend each expose a distinct operator gap.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Operator UX: how discoverable are the expansive-depth flags and defaults, how is the budget sized, and how clear are the warnings, dashboards, reports and the fan-out dry-run preview? How does an operator recover mid-run from a provider quota failure, resume, extend, or rerun one failed lineage?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"The dashboard hiding band spend\\\",\\\"A new summary file\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"operator-ux\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/orchestration-summary.json:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/observability-events.jsonl:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:108\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:107\\\"],\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"orchestration-summary.json reports only aggregate failure classes; it has no per-lineage label/status/reason/rerun_command array, so an operator must open the status log to learn which lineage failed and what to type.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/orchestration-summary.json:1\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\\\",\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/fanout-config-recovery.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-002\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The dashboard frontier section shows band spend and a node count but no per-node visits or status, so three single-node passes and three passes on one node look identical even though the registry already holds the visit records.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:108\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2491\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-003\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Every observability-events.jsonl row carries subject.run_id null, so the event stream cannot be joined to a run or a lineage without parsing free text.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/observability-events.jsonl:1\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4801\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-004\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The quota failure names the cause but not the action; the single-executor workflow already has the actionable line 'Switch executor or wait, then resume this run', and the fan-out path does not carry it or a lineage-specific resume step.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:4714\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:1898\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-005\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A 3-node CLI lineage gets the flat 10-iteration floor, which funds only 5 depth-1 visits; this lineage's own dashboard shows 3 of 5 spent after three first passes, leaving no room for the verification pass each node needs.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-dashboard.md:113\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:107\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:844\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Claiming the dashboard hides band spend\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The dashboard prints all three band allotments and their spend; the missing dimension is per-node detail.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1795137977667,"end":1795137980805}}}}
