tus\":\"pruned\",\"reason\":\"fanout\",\"iteration\":3,\"dedupeKey\":\"do the dispatch receipts under each lineage carry slotdurationms and can that field be joined to the iteration row to separate model time from queue time in the archive runs\"}\n{\"nodeId\":\"F-2-012\",\"parentId\":\"F-1-006\",\"depth\":2,\"scope\":\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml, .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml, review/lineages\",\"question\":\"What is the measured setup time per executor kind, and does skipping the context ladder in a fan-out child actually remove it?\",\"status\":\"pruned\",\"reason\":\"fanout\",\"iteration\":3,\"dedupeKey\":\"what is the measured setup time per executor kind and does skipping the context ladder in a fan out child actually remove it\"}\n===\nFrontier node F-1-004 (depth 1, scope .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs, .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts): Cross-CLI parity: whe\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode --artifact-dir specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek 2>&1 | tail -4; echo ===; tail -8 specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/frontier-nodes.jsonl; echo ===; sed -n '/ANCHOR:next-focus/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md | sed -n '3p' | cut -c1-200\"}"},"time":{"start":1795138003679,"end":1795138004501}}}}
