f-iter008-004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The frontier marker regex and the frontier dashboard renderer are implemented twice in different trees, and the review copy already has the visits field and active-node line the research copy lacks; one shared frontier-projection module removes both copies.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1360\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2485\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2520\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The Flash effort pin is mirrored in fanout-run.cjs and executor-config.ts, and native is a fan-out adapter that cannot start on OpenCode v2; importing the pin and removing native deletes about 45 lines and one version-dependent path.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:2650\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:328\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3558\"]}\n","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":8,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Q1 restraint: which lines and concepts can be deleted, merged or collapsed across frontier-admit.cjs, both reduce-state.cjs reducers, convergence.cjs, fanout-run.cjs and the two workflow YAMLs while every promise stays kept?\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":5,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Five new deletion findings, including a 300-line handler collapse that also closes the iteration-5 permission defect.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What can be deleted, merged or collapsed across runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs, both reduce-state.cjs reducers, runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs, runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs and the two workflow YAMLs while every promise stays kept?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What can be deleted, merged or collapsed across runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs, both reduce-state.cjs reducers, runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs, runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs and the two workflow YAMLs while every promise stays kept?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Deleting frontier-admit.cjs\\\",\\\"Collapsing the two reducers into one file\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"restraint\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:354\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:919\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:1762\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:395\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1360\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:2650\\\"],\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"dispatch-iteration.cjs hand-builds claude and codex while four other kinds use buildLineageCommand; routing the two through the shared builder deletes about 300 lines and closes the acceptEdits drift.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:354\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:919\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:478\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-002\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Six of the eight executor branches in each YAML are the same command with a different --executor value, and their notes restate EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT; one if_cli branch plus the two special cases deletes about 100 lines per YAML.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:1762\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:1819\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:112\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-003\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The research YAML writes step_frontier_seed twice, the fan-out preview command twice, and two pre-spawn refusal guards in the same shape; collapsing them removes about 50 lines.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:395\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:816\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:300\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:372\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-004\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The frontier marker regex and the frontier dashboard renderer are implemented twice in different trees, and the review copy already has the visits field and active-node line the research copy lacks; one shared frontier-projection module removes both copies.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1360\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2485\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2520\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-005\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The Flash effort pin is mirrored in fanout-run.cjs and executor-config.ts, and native is a fan-out adapter that cannot start on OpenCode v2; importing the pin and removing native deletes about 45 lines and one version-dependent path.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:2650\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:328\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:3558\\\"]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1795138180665,"end":1795138183370}}}}
