{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795138221413,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f6936b6f002kF7jrQ0N53Kh4K","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f69362710017WwG8Vln5Shsi0","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd27ea34939136ca","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":9,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":9,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Q5 design questions: should research count stuck passes per frontier node as review now does, does the lineage completion check break resume and extend for older committed research lineages, and is there a cheap design that makes pivot admission into the frontier work?\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Five new findings, including a measured 31-of-104 completion population that corrects the prompt's 3-of-12 premise.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Should research count stuck passes per frontier node as review now does, does the lineage completion check break resume and extend for older committed research lineages, and is there a cheap design that makes pivot admission into the frontier work?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Should research count stuck passes per frontier node as review now does, does the lineage completion check break resume and extend for older committed research lineages, and is there a cheap design that makes pivot admission into the frontier work?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Weakening the live completion check\",\"A reworked pivot transaction\"],\"focusTrack\":\"design\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/s