esearch.yaml:2199\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/lineage-timestamp-window.ts:169\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-004\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Pivot admission has a cheap design: copy the saturated focus's scope, skip only the relevance check for origin:pivot, reserve one depth-1 slot, and order frontier_drained before all_dimensions_clean.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/011-review-frontier-mode/decision-record.md:68\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs:613\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1158\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter009-005\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"The reducer copies a leaf's Recommended Next Focus narrative into Next Focus verbatim; when the frontier is terminal it should prefer the first unchecked key question and reject a recommendation that is not a question.\",\"iteration\":9,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2574\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md:151\"]}\n","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-deepseek-1795137583671-xybhyk\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":9,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Q5 design questions: should research count stuck passes per frontier node as review now does, does the lineage completion check break resume and extend for older committed research lineages, and is there a cheap design that makes pivot admission into the frontier work?\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":5,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Five new findings, including a measured 31-of-104 completion population that corrects the prompt's 3-of-12 premise.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Should research count stuck passes per frontier node as review now does, does the lineage completion check break resume and extend for older committed research lineages, and is there a cheap design that makes pivot admission into the frontier work?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Should research count stuck passes per frontier node as review now does, does the lineage completion check break resume and extend for older committed research lineages, and is there a cheap design that makes pivot admission into the frontier work?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Weakening the live completion check\\\",\\\"A reworked pivot transaction\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"design\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1775\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1248\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/lineage-timestamp-window.ts:202\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2574\\\",\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/011-review-frontier-mode/decision-record.md:68\\\"],\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter009-001\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Research counts stuck passes lineage-wide because nodeScoped is gated on loopType === 'review' at convergence.cjs:1775; drop the gate and add frontier.activeNodeId to the research projection.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1775\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1406\\\",\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/011-review-frontier-mode/decision-record.md:69\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter009-002\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P1\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"31 of 104 committed research state logs have research.md but no terminal closeout row, so the completion check would mark them failed on any audit or re-run that does not re-run synthesis; fall back to completionFromArtifacts for a completed historical config.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1248\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/lineage-timestamp-window.ts:202\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs:1282\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter009-003\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Resume and extend are not broken by the completion check: every re-run writes a fresh closeout row in step_convergence_report, so only historical audit needs the artifact fallback.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml:2199\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/lineage-timestamp-window.ts:169\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter009-004\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Pivot admission has a cheap design: copy the saturated focus's scope, skip only the relevance check for origin:pivot, reserve one depth-1 slot, and order frontier_drained before all_dimensions_clean.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/011-review-frontier-mode/decision-record.md:68\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs:613\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs:1158\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter009-005\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The reducer copies a leaf's Recommended Next Focus narrative into Next Focus verbatim; when the frontier is terminal it should prefer the first unchecked key question and reject a recommendation that is not a question.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":9,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs:2574\\\",\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md:151\\\"]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deltas/iter-009.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1795138218863,"end":1795138221413}}}}
