{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795138376622,"sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","part":{"partID":"prt_1f695cf27002Nwwz4aRc2Nd53K","sessionID":"ses_e09762d57ffewQMol0oGMct7ei","messageID":"msg_1f695be8d001QgqVj9k9M2I7ub","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1cd5ffdadb4bbf2","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Per-iteration latency attribution needs host-measured `durationMs`; the committed runs do not carry it.\n- The detached lineage cannot emit its own `resource-map.md`: `reduce-state.cjs --emit-resource-map` resolves the config from the fan-out base (`research/deep-research-config.json`), which the dispatcher archived before spawning, so the step fails at synthesis with `ENOENT`. The root's `fanout-merge`/resource-map step owns that artifact; a lineage-side fallback to its own `deep-research-config.json` would make the step runnable here. This is observed, not fixed (report-only scope).","oldString":"- Per-iteration latency attribution needs host-measured `durationMs`; the committed runs do not carry it.","path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md\n+++ specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md\n@@ -186,8 +186,9 @@\n \n - The three duplicate legacy questions remain open (8/11 answered) because their text differs from the frontier rows that were answered. That is the duplicate-intake defect in Q2, observed on this run.\n - The failed 429 attempt's summary was not preserved, so the quota recovery path is read from code and the committed recovery config rather than from the failed run's own artifacts.\n - Per-iteration latency attribution needs host-measured `durationMs`; the committed runs do not carry it.\n+- The detached lineage cannot emit its own `resource-map.md`: `reduce-state.cjs --emit-resource-map` resolves the config from the fan-out base (`research/deep-research-config.json`), which the dispatcher archived before spawning, so the step fails at synthesis with `ENOENT`. The root's `fanout-merge`/resource-map step owns that artifact; a lineage-side fallback to its own `deep-research-config.json` would make the step runnable here. This is observed, not fixed (report-only scope).\n \n ## 10. Convergence Report\n \n - Stop reason: `maxIterationsReached` (10 of 10).\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"- Per-iteration latency attribution needs host-measured `durationMs`; the committed runs do not carry it.\\n- The detached lineage cannot emit its own `resource-map.md`: `reduce-state.cjs --emit-resource-map` resolves the config from the fan-out base (`research/deep-research-config.json`), which the dispatcher archived before spawning, so the step fails at synthesis with `ENOENT`. The root's `fanout-merge`/resource-map step owns that artifact; a lineage-side fallback to its own `deep-research-config.json` would make the step runnable here. This is observed, not fixed (report-only scope).\", \"oldString\": \"- Per-iteration latency attribution needs host-measured `durationMs`; the committed runs do not carry it.\", \"path\": \"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/research.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1795138375463,"end":1795138376622}}}}
